# ============================================================
#  Caddyfile · 遇见江楠 静态博客
#  被 deploy/setup-vps.sh 自动写入 /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
#  也可手动复制：Caddyfile 路径 → /etc/caddy/Caddyfile
# ============================================================

# 1) 主域 + www 都直接服务静态文件
#    Caddy 自动申请/续期 Let's Encrypt 证书
#    （备案通过前证书会申请失败，属预期；备案通过后自动成功）
www.jiangnanstudio.cloud, jiangnanstudio.cloud {
    root * /home/studio/app/public
    encode gzip zstd
    try_files {path} {path}/ /index.html
    file_server
    header {
        Cache-Control "public, max-age=2592000"
    }
    @assets path /assets/*
    header @assets Cache-Control "public, max-age=2592000, immutable"
}

# 2) 备案期间临时纯 IP + 80 端口直连验收
#    （不经过域名，绕过未备案拦截；备案通过后删掉此块即可恢复域名 HTTPS）
:80 {
    root * /home/studio/app/public
    encode gzip zstd
    try_files {path} {path}/ /index.html
    file_server
}
